          "filename": "West Wales lines Map.png",
          "caption": "Map of the West Wales lines, a collection of railway line branches of the Wales and Borders franchise, west of Swansea, Wales to either Pembroke Dock, Milford Haven or Fishguard Harbour. Translations of stations in Welsh are labelled on the map underneath the English name, a lack of translation means the only name present is used in both Welsh and English. Request stops are marked with an asterisk (*). Heritage railway lines are coloured brown. Nearby heritage stations are also labelled. National Rail stations connecting to other lines are marked with a black and white roundel. Proposed stations have faded icons and labels. Map made to style produced by Rcsprinter123. This map may not be complete, and should not be used solely for navigation.",
          "alt": "Map of the West Wales lines, a collection of railway line branches of the Wales and Borders franchise, west of Swansea, Wales to either Pembroke Dock, Milford Haven or Fishguard Harbour. Translations of stations in Welsh are labelled on the map underneath the English name, a lack of translation means the only name present is used in both Welsh and English. Request stops are marked with an asterisk (*). Heritage railway lines are coloured brown. Nearby heritage stations are also labelled. National Rail stations connecting to other lines are marked with a black and white roundel. Proposed stations have faded icons and labels. Map made to style produced by Rcsprinter123. This map may not be complete, and should not be used solely for navigation.",
